/*!
 * \namespace anch::network
 *
 * \brief Network namespace.
 *
 * Network sockets as C++ streams (POSIX only, IPv4 and IPv6):
 * - \ref anch::network::TcpStream : a TCP connection as a \c std::iostream ;
 * - \ref anch::network::TcpServer : accept connections as \ref anch::network::TcpStream ;
 * - \ref anch::network::UdpSocket : UDP datagrams ;
 * - \ref anch::network::Socket and \ref anch::network::Address : RAII socket and resolved address used by the
 *   classes above.
 *
 * Errors are reported with \ref anch::network::IOException (a \c std::system_error with the \c errno value).
 */
